      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "线向左移动$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "余弦函数在闭区间$[0,\\pi]$上是下降的，并且由于连续性，",
        "它取闭区间$[-1,1]$里所有的值。因此，函数$y=\\cos x$在闭区",
        "间$[0,\\pi]$上是可逆函数。在闭区间$[0,\\pi]$上余弦的反函数叫做",
        "反余弦，记作$\\arccos$。函数$y=\\arccos x$的图象表示在图31",
        "中。这个图象和函数$y=\\cos x$（$x\\in[0,\\pi]$）的图象关于直线",
        "$y=x$是对称的。由反函数的定义得出，$D(\\arccos)=[-1,1]$，",
        "$E(\\arccos)=[0,\\pi]$，而且反余弦是",
        "减函数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来计算几个反余弦的值："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\arccos\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$，",
        "因为$\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{6}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$，",
        "而且$\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\in[0,\\pi]$；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 31",
      "box": [
        1017,
        939,
        447,
        500
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-31"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 31",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图 31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\arccos\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{\\pi}{3}$，因为$\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{3}=\\frac{1}{2}$，",
        "而且$\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\in[0,\\pi]$；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\arccos\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$，因为$\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$，",
        "而且$\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\in[0,\\pi]$；"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\arccos 0=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$，因为$\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{2}=0$，"
      ]
    },
